# The gateway's access code is the only thing guarding the model runtime
# from the public internet. It must never reach the repo — the repo is
# public, and a published code is the same as no code at all.
local-engine/access-code.txt
local-engine/gateway.log

# The relay's access code — same reasoning: it is the only thing stopping a
